    </div>
    <ol style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; padding-left: 20px; font-weight: bold;">
        <li>Applicant details should match in both English and Arabic in SPA Particulars. (Check on blanks and update)</li>
        <li>Floor plan to be checked with SPA particulars.</li>
        <li>Material specifications to match the type of the unit enclosed.</li>
        <li>RM to download the SPA from SF and check the downloaded SPA on basis of the checklist and booking form. TL to recheck the SPA.</li>
        <li>IT to ensure that there are no further changes once the SPA is downloaded and uploaded in SF.</li>
    </ol-->
</apex:page>